cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or mention safe-ai-coding, please cite it like this."
title: "safe-ai-coding: guardrails for AI coding agents (Claude Code skill)"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source Claude Code skill that makes AI coding agents safer:
  it asks permission before risky actions and explains the harm, catches typical
  AI coding mistakes (hallucinated symbols, elided code, injection, leaked
  secrets, destructive changes), reviews changes from an AI and a human
  perspective, and produces a PDF report on request.
